                    <p {...stylex.attrs(blogStyles.articleParagraph)}>
                        The PWA runs entirely offline via Service Worker. The
                        first load caches the ~1.8MB ONNX model, and from that
                        point it is airplane-mode ready. One critical detail:
                        I had to write a custom bilinear resize in JavaScript
                        that exactly matches PIL/Pillow's implementation to
                        ensure consistent preprocessing between the training
                        pipeline and browser inference. A 1-pixel difference
                        in resize interpolation will silently destroy accuracy.
                    </p>

                    <div {...stylex.attrs(blogStyles.imageWrapper)}>
